+# Changes — round 0
+
+This is round 0: there are no prior findings, so this round addresses none.
+
+## What changed
+
+- `src/truncate.mjs` (new): exports `truncate(text, max)`. Text of at most
+  `max` characters comes back unchanged (the boundary at exactly `max` is
+  unchanged). Longer text is cut to `max - 1` characters and "…" (U+2026, one
+  character) is appended, so the result is exactly `max` characters long; with
+  a `max` of 1 the result is just "…". Whitespace is kept as-is, never trimmed.
+  A `text` that is not a string throws `TypeError`; a `max` that is not a
+  positive integer (`0`, `-1`, `2.5`, `"3"`, `NaN`, `Infinity`, `null`,
+  `undefined`) throws `RangeError`. Style matches `src/pad.mjs`.
+- `tests/truncate.test.mjs` (new): `node:test` + `node:assert/strict` tests
+  covering the unchanged cases (shorter and exactly `max`), the cut case with
+  exact length and the ellipsis character, one-over-`max`, `max` of 1, the
+  single-character ellipsis vs. three dots, whitespace handling, and each
+  refused value. No test is skipped or marked todo.
+- `CHANGELOG.md`: added a line under `## Unreleased` for `truncate`, in the
+  style of the `padStart` entry.
+- `CHANGES.md` (this file).
+
+Nothing outside `src/`, `tests/`, `CHANGELOG.md` and `CHANGES.md` changed.
